TI SCI Resource Manager

Syntax:
  tisci-mgr [-v] [-p]

Options:
  -v - Turn on verbose
  -p - Configure sciclient calls to run in polling mode (default interrupt mode)
       Note: Interrupt mode is not supported on J722S, and therefore tisci-mgr
       defaults to polling mode without this option.
       Note: Currently interrupt mode is not functional with SDP 8.0 and will
       also default to polling mode.

Note:
  The previous default operation mode for sciclient calls was polling mode. If
  problems are found with tisci-mgr try starting with the -p option.
